      Case Study
    </h2>
    <h2 class="heading-underline text-white font-display text-5xl max-w-[21ch] mb-6 text-center">
      Wiley Education | Campbellsville University
    </h2>
    <div class="text-colorText-body max-w-[84ch] whitespace-pre-line text-center">Wiley supports the higher education and business communities in their education and training endeavors, with the goal of helping more people achieve their career goals. 

Campbellsville University, founded in 1906, is a widely-acclaimed private university in Campbellsville, Kentucky.</div>
    <div class="text-colorText-body text-center mt-16 flex flex-col gap-0 [&_strong]:text-white">
      <p>
        <strong>Video Type:</strong> Ad <strong>Production Company:</strong> Studio Say So <strong>Services:</strong> Creative, Full Production
        <br />
        <strong>Director:</strong> Marshall Head, Danny Miller <strong> Producer:</strong> Mackenzie Wiler <strong>Cinematographer:</strong> <span style="font-weight: 400;">Erik Van Lenten </span><strong>Editor:</strong> Audri Tearpak
      </p>
    </div>
